WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.377
This slide asks you to strengthen a CHECK constraint
The clinic does

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:09.811
not allow negative standard prices but the current
threshold is deliberately too

00:00:09.838 --> 00:00:15.653
weak Run the example first so you understand its
current behavior

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:19.985
Then change the threshold from negative one hundred
to zero and run

00:00:20.011 --> 00:00:26.062
it again After the correction the negative test
value should be rejected

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:33.755
In this exercise rejection is success It means
PostgreSQL is enforcing

00:00:33.782 --> 00:00:39.277
the business rule Pay attention to the difference
between fixing the data

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:43.885
and fixing the rule We are changing the schema
constraint so future

00:00:43.911 --> 00:00:47.714
invalid values are also protected not only
correcting one row
